<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104228" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόλμ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τολμάω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adventure, enterprise,
				daring</i> or <i>shameless act,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> (not in <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>), mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1064
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1222
			</span></i>, al.: sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1676
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τολμᾶτον οὐκ ἀνασχετόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					419
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				636c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			language, <i>a bold expression,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Meth.</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
